ght:14px;display:block"/></span>Habilidad 4</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr id="41d60020-1048-80b9-a28b-e2ef053ba216"><td class="cell-title"><a href="TotV%20Creaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Personajes/LINAJES/Animalido%2041d60020104880b9a28be2ef053ba216.html" data-notion-page-id="41d60020-1048-80b9-a28b-e2ef053ba216" data-notion-space-id="45e60020-1048-8158-b5e6-000390bb8870">Animalido</a></td><td class="cell-tmPH"><span class="selected-value select-value-color-red">PG</span></td><td class="cell-@s:n"><strong>Instinto animal. <br/></strong>Eres competente con la habilidad Percepción o Supervivencia (a tu elección).</td><td class="cell-k&gt;[L"><strong>Armas naturales.</strong><br/> Tienes alguna adaptación animal que sirve como arma natural (Ej. Garras). Puedes usarla para hacer ataques sin arma. El ataque inflige 1d6 + tu modificador por FUE o DES de daño (elige durante la creación del personaje).<br/></td><td class="cell-ByoG"><strong>Adaptación natural.<br/></strong>Heredas una determinada característica animal, la que quieres que tenga tu personaje:</td><td class="cell-^Ouq">—</td></tr><tr id="41d60020-1048-800e-a30e-c3540f3c4dad"><td class="cell-title"><a href="TotV%20Creaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Personajes/LINAJES/Elfo%2041d600201048800ea30ec3540f3c4dad.html" data-notion-page-id="41d60020-1048-800e-a30e-c3540f3c4dad" data-notion-space-id="45e60020-1048-8158-b5e6-000390bb8870">Elfo</a></td><td class="cell-tmPH"><span class="selected-value select-value-color-red">PG</span></td><td class="cell-@s:n"><strong>Sentidos agudos. </strong><br/>Tienes ventaja en las pruebas de Percepción que se basan en la vista o el oído. Puede ver en zonas ligeramente oscuras con normalidad y en zonas de luz tenue como si fuera luz brillante.</td><td class="cell-k&gt;[L"><strong>Linaje mágico. </strong><br/>Tienes ventaja en las tiradas de salvación para evitar que te hechicen y la magia no puede dormirte.</td><td class="cell-ByoG"><strong>Trance. </strong><br/>Los elfos no necesitan dormir. En cambio, entran en un estado de trance meditativo, permaneciendo semiconscientes durante 4 horas al día. </td><td class="cell-^Ouq">—</td></tr><tr id="41d60020-1048-808a-bb0d-f9ab1594510c"><td class="cell-title"><a href="TotV%20Creaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Personajes/LINAJES/Enano%2041d600201048808abb0df9ab1594510c.html" data-notion-page-id="41d60020-1048-808a-bb0d-f9ab1594510c" data-notion-space-id="45e60020-1048-8158-b5e6-000390bb8870">Enano</a></td><td class="cell-tmPH"><span class="selected-value select-value-color-red">PG</span></td><td class="cell-@s:n"><strong>Visión en la oscuridad.</strong><br/>Obtienes visión en la oscuridad hasta un rango de 60 pies.</td><td class="cell-k&gt;[L"><strong>Resistencia enana.</strong><br/>Tienes ventaja en las tiradas de salvación contra veneno y posees resistencia al daño de veneno.</td><td class="cell-ByoG"><strong>Aguante enano.</strong><br/>Tus puntos de golpe máximos se incrementan en 1 y aumentarán en 1 más cada vez que subas un nivel.</td><td class="cell-^Ouq">—</td></tr><tr id="41d60020-1048-80b5-add1-e4eb8007f7c1"><td class="cell-title"><a href="TotV%20Creaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Personajes/LINAJES/Humano%2041d60020104880b5add1e4eb8007f7c1.html" data-notion-page-id="41d60020-1048-80b5-add1-e4eb8007f7c1" data-notion-space-id="45e60020-1048-8158-b5e6-000390bb8870">Humano</a></td><td class="cell-tmPH"><span class="selected-value select-value-color-red">PG</span></td><td class="cell-@s:n"><strong>Ambicioso. </strong><br/>Obtienes competencia en una habilidad a tu elección y un talento a tu elección. </td><td class="cell-k&gt;[L">—</td><td class="cell-ByoG">—</td><td class="cell-^Ouq">—</td></tr><tr id="41d60020-1048-8020-8b91-e3a7558c3e51"><td class="cell-title"><a href="TotV%20Creaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Personajes/LINAJES/Kobold%2041d60020104880208b91e3a7558c3e51.html" data-notion-page-id="41d60020-1048-8020-8b91-e3a7558c3e51" data-notion-space-id="45e60020-1048-8158-b5e6-000390bb8870">Kobold</a></td><td class="cell-tmPH"><span class="selected-value select-value-color-red">PG</span></td><td class="cell-@s:n"><strong>Visión en la oscuridad. <br/></strong>Hasta un rango de 60 pies.</td><td class="cell-k&gt;[L"><strong>Fascinación de manitas. </strong><br/>Cuando hagas una prueba de característica en la que uses una herramienta, puedes tirar 1d8 y añadirlo al resultado.</td><td class="cell-ByoG">Adaptación natural. <br/>Heredas una determinada característica ancestral, según lo determine tu tamaño:</td><td class="cell-^Ouq">—</td></tr><tr id="41d60020-1048-8025-a5da-ec6613ea3b71"><td class="cell-title"><a href="TotV%20Creaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Personajes/LINAJES/Menudos%2041d6002010488025a5daec6613ea3b71.html" data-notion-page-id="41d60020-1048-8025-a5da-ec6613ea3b71" data-notion-space-id="45e60020-1048-8158-b5e6-000390bb8870">Menudos</a></td><td class="cell-tmPH"><span class="selected-value select-value-color-red">PG</span></td><td class="cell-@s:n"><strong>Sensato. </strong><br/>Una vez al día, cuando fallas una tirada de salvación, puedes volver a tirar el dado y quedarte el nuevo resultado. Si la nueva tirada es un éxito o un fracaso, generas 1 punto de Suerte.</td><td class="cell-k&gt;[L"><strong>Baja estatura. </strong><br/>Puedes moverte (O esconderte en) por el espacio que ocupe cualquier criatura Mediana o más grande.</td><td class="cell-ByoG"><strong>Adaptación natural. </strong><br/>Heredaste uno de los siguientes atributos únicos, según si tus características son de gnomo o mediano:</td><td class="cell-^Ouq">—</td></tr><tr id="41d60020-1048-8047-96b2-fea11c0a1ea2"><td class="cell-title"><a href="TotV%20Creaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Personajes/LINAJES/Orcos%2041d600201048804796b2fea11c0a1ea2.html" data-notion-page-id="41d60020-1048-8047-96b2-fea11c0a1ea2" data-notion-space-id="45e60020-1048-8158-b5e6-000390bb8870">Orcos</a></td><td class="cell-tmPH"><span class="selected-value select-value-color-red">PG</span></td><td class="cell-@s:n"><strong>Sentidos agudos. </strong><br/>Tienes ventaja en las pruebas de Percepción que se basan en la vista o el oído. Puede ver en zonas ligeramente oscuras con normalidad y en zonas de luz tenue como si fuera luz brillante.</td><td class="cell-k&gt;[L"><strong>Perseverancia orca. <br/></strong>En lugar de morir de asfixia o a causa de tus niveles de cansancio, entras en una estasis similar a la muerte y quedas incapacitado, no puedes moverte, no puedes hablar y no eres consciente de tu entorno. También dejas de envejecer y tu cuerpo no se descompone. Puedes permanecer en este estado hasta que te sanen por medios mágicos o mundanos, o hasta que tu cuerpo sea completamente destruido.</td><td class="cell-ByoG"><strong>Fornido. </strong><br/>Cuando se te exija hacer una tirada de salvación al final de tu turno, puedes elegir hacerla al comienzo de tu turno.</td><td class="cell-^Ouq">—</td></tr><tr id="41d60020-1048-80f1-b81c-cc794070646a"><td class="cell-title"><a href="TotV%20Creaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Personajes/LINAJES/Syderiano%2041d60020104880f1b81ccc794070646a.html" data-notion-page-id="41d60020-1048-80f1-b81c-cc794070646a" data-notion-space-id="45e60020-1048-8158-b5e6-000390bb8870">Syderiano</a></td><td class="cell-tmPH"><span class="selected-value select-value-color-red">PG</span></td><td class="cell-@s:n"><strong>Visión lejana.</strong><br/>Puedes ver en la oscuridad a una distancia de 60 pies y en la oscuridad mágica a una distancia de 30 pies.</td><td class="cell-k&gt;[L"><strong>Forma de otro mundo.</strong><br/>Tienes resistencia al daño necrótico y la cantidad de tiempo que puedes sobrevivir sin aire, comida, agua o sueño es el doble que la de otros personajes.</td><td class="cell-ByoG"><strong>Adaptación natural. </strong><br/>Has heredado un conjunto de los siguientes atributos únicos, determinados por la naturaleza de las fuerzas que te dieron forma:</td><td class="cell-^Ouq">—</td></tr><tr id="41d60020-1048-8059-8a7e-f46a9099b870"><td class="cell-title"><a href="TotV%20Creaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Personajes/LINAJES/Dhampir%2041d60020104880598a7ef46a9099b870.html" data-notion-page-id="41d60020-1048-8059-8a7e-f46a9099b870" data-notion-space-id="45e60020-1048-8158-b5e6-000390bb8870">Dhampir</a></td><td class="cell-tmPH"><span class="selected-value select-value-color-brown">PG2</span></td><td class="cell-@s:n"><strong>Dark Thirst.<br/></strong>You have short fangs that serve as a natural weapon. Your fangs counts as a simple melee weapon with which you are proficient. You choose whether you add your STR or DEX modifier to attack rolls made with your fangs. On a hit, your bite deals 1d4 piercing damage. If your target isn’t a Construct or Undead, you can feed from it as part of your attack. If you choose to do so, your target takes an additional 1d4 necrotic damage, you gain temporary hit points equal to the necrotic damage dealt, and you have advantage on the next attack roll you make before the end of your next turn.</td><td class="cell-k&gt;[L"><strong>Darkvision.</strong><br/>You have darkvision to a range of 60 feet. While in sunlight, you have disadvantage on WIS (Perception) checks when perceiving by sight.</td><td class="cell-ByoG"><strong>Hybrid Humanoid.</strong><br/>You are a Humanoid, but your vampiric blood gives you traits in common with Undead. You have advantage on saves against being poisoned and advantage on checks made to resist suffering levels of exhaustion.</td><td class="cell-^Ouq">—</td></tr><tr id="41d60020-1048-806b-bef8-e84445fa60ce"><td class="cell-title"><a href="TotV%20Creaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Personajes/LINAJES/Dragonborn%2041d600201048806bbef8e84445fa60ce.html" data-notion-page-id="41d60020-1048-806b-bef8-e84445fa60ce" data-notion-space-id="45e60020-1048-8158-b5e6-000390bb8870">Dragonborn</a></td><td class="cell-tmPH"><span class="selected-value select-value-color-brown">PG2</span></td><td class="cell-@s:n"><strong>Draconic Ancestry.</strong><br/>Choose one type of dragon from the Draconic Ancestry table. Your dragon type determines your Breath Weapon damage type and damage resistance.</td><td class="cell-k&gt;[L"><strong>Breath Weapon. </strong><br/>As a bonus action, you can exhale magical energy in either a 30-foot line that is 5 feet wide or a 15-foot cone (your choice for each use).</td><td class="cell-ByoG"><strong>Dragon Hide.</strong><br/>You have resistance to the damage type associated with your draconic ancestry.</td><td class="cell-^Ouq"><strong>Dragon Sight.</strong><br/>You have darkvision to a range of 60 feet and keensense to a range of 10 feet.</td></tr><tr id="41d60020-1048-80dc-8ea4-dc9008079ebc"><td class="cell-title"><a href="TotV%20Creaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Personajes/LINAJES/Drow%20(Elf)%2041d60020104880dc8ea4dc9008079ebc.html" data-notion-page-id="41d60020-1048-80dc-8ea4-dc9008079ebc" data-notion-space-id="45e60020-1048-8158-b5e6-000390bb8870">Drow (Elf)</a></td><td class="cell-tmPH"><span class="selected-value select-value-color-brown">PG2</span></td><td class="cell-@s:n"><strong>Arachnid Kismet.</strong><br/>You have advantage on checks made to interact with spiders, scorpions, and similar eight-legged Beasts. In addition, when you make an attack roll or save and the final result includes the number 8 (such as 8, 18, 28), you can choose to gain 1 Luck (in addition to any Luck you would normally get).</td><td class="cell-k&gt;[L"><strong>Superior Darkvision.</strong><br/>You have darkvision to a range of 120 feet. While you are in an area of sunlight, you have disadvantage on WIS (Perception) checks made to perceive via sight.</td><td class="cell-ByoG"><strong>Trance. </strong><br/>Los elfos no necesitan dormir. En cambio, entran en un estado de trance meditativo, permaneciendo semiconscientes durante 4 horas al día. </td><td class="cell-^Ouq">—</td></tr><tr id="41d60020-1048-8035-82b9-c736d7a444c7"><td class="cell-title"><a href="TotV%20Creaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Personajes/LINAJES/Duergar%2041d600201048803582b9c736d7a444c7.html" data-notion-page-id="41d60020-1048-8035-82b9-c736d7a444c7" data-notion-space-id="45e60020-1048-8158-b5e6-000390bb8870">Duergar</a></td><td class="cell-tmPH"><span class="selected-value select-value-color-brown">PG2</span></td><td class="cell-@s:n"><strong>Duergar Resilience.</strong><br/>You have advantage on saves against being charmed or paralyzed. You also have advantage on checks made to see through, detect, or resist illusions and illusory effects.</td><td class="cell-k&gt;[L"><strong>Enlarge.</strong> <br/>As a bonus action, you magically increase in size for 1 minute, along with any equipment you are wearing or wielding. While enlarged, you are Large, double your damage dice on weapon attacks, and make STR checks and saves with advantage (…). </td><td class="cell-ByoG"><strong>Superior Darkvision.<br/></strong>You have darkvision to a range of 120 feet. While you are in an area of sunlight, you have disadvantage on WIS (Perception) checks made to perceive via sight.</td><td class="cell-^Ouq">—</td></tr><tr id="41d60020-1048-8093-a6f1-e173ac03321f"><td class="cell-title"><a href="TotV%20Creaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Personajes/LINAJES/Elemental%20Scion%2041d6002010488093a6f1e173ac03321f.html" data-notion-page-id="41d60020-1048-8093-a6f1-e173ac03321f" data-notion-space-id="45e60020-1048-8158-b5e6-000390bb8870">Elemental Scion</a></td><td class="cell-tmPH"><span class="selected-value select-value-color-brown">PG2</span></td><td class="cell-@s:n"><strong>Darkvision.</strong><br/>You have darkvision to a range of 60 feet.</td><td class="cell-k&gt;[L"><strong>Hybrid Humanoid. </strong><br/>You are resistant to poison damage and one of the following damage types based on which Natural Adaption trait you choose: acid (earthborn), fire (fireborn), cold (waterborn), or lightning (windborn). In addition, you have advantage on saves against being paralyzed, petrified, or poisoned.</td><td class="cell-ByoG"><strong>Natural Adaptation. </strong><br/>You have inherited one set of the following unique traits, determined by the nature of the elemental forces that shaped you: <strong>Earthborn, Fireborn, Waterborn or Windborn.</strong></td><td class="cell-^Ouq">—</td></tr><tr id="41d60020-1048-8002-a8ec-f89ab2f5f5aa"><td class="cell-title"><a href="TotV%20Creaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Personajes/LINAJES/Gearforged%2041d6002010488002a8ecf89ab2f5f5aa.html" data-notion-page-id="41d60020-1048-8002-a8ec-f89ab2f5f5aa" data-notion-space-id="45e60020-1048-8158-b5e6-000390bb8870">Gearforged</a></td><td class="cell-tmPH"><span class="selected-value select-value-color-brown">PG2</span></td><td class="cell-@s:n"><strong>Constructed Vitality.</strong><br/>You don’t need to eat, drink, or breathe, and you don’t sleep the way most creatures do. Instead, you enter a dormant state for 6 hours a day, where you resemble a statue and remain semiconscious. While in this state, you have disadvantage on WIS (Perception) checks. After resting in this way, you gain the same benefit that other creatures do from 8 hours of sleep.</td><td class="cell-k&gt;[L"><strong>Hybrid Humanoid.</strong><br/>You are immune to disease, and you are resistant to poison damage. In addition, you have advantage on saves against being paralyzed, petrified, or poisoned.</td><td class="cell-ByoG"><strong>Machine Speech.</strong><br/>You can speak and understand Machine Speech, a mechanical language of clicks, beeps, and clacks spoken primarily by gearforged and mechadrons.</td><td class="cell-^Ouq"><strong>Upgrade.</strong><br/>Choose one of the following traits to represent a specialized function built into your chassis: <strong>Always Armed, Bulk Up or Quick Fix.</strong></td></tr><tr id="41d60020-1048-803c-8689-cc45d5a6e971"><td class="cell-title"><a href="TotV%20Creaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Personajes/LINAJES/Goblin%2041d600201048803c8689cc45d5a6e971.html" data-notion-page-id="41d60020-1048-803c-8689-cc45d5a6e971" data-notion-space-id="45e60020-1048-8158-b5e6-000390bb8870">Goblin</a></td><td class="cell-tmPH"><span class="selected-value select-value-color-brown">PG2</span></td><td class="cell-@s:n"><strong>Darkvision.</strong><br/>You have darkvision to a range of 60 feet.</td><td class="cell-k&gt;[L"><strong>Nimble Escape.</strong><br/>You can use a bonus action to take the Disengage or Hide action.</td><td class="cell-ByoG"><strong>Strength in Numbers.</strong><br/>When you deal damage to a creature with a weapon attack or spell attack while one of your allies is within 5 feet of that creature, your attack deals additional damage of the same damage type equal to your PB.</td><td class="cell-^Ouq">—</td></tr><tr id="41d60020-1048-807a-a00f-dda81c1493a9"><td class="cell-title"><a href="TotV%20Creaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Personajes/LINAJES/Rachisan%2041d600201048807aa00fdda81c1493a9.html" data-notion-page-id="41d60020-1048-807a-a00f-dda81c1493a9" data-notion-space-id="45e60020-1048-8158-b5e6-000390bb8870">Rachisan</a></td><td class="cell-tmPH"><span class="selected-value select-value-color-brown">PG2</span></td><td class="cell-@s:n"><strong>Hybrid Humanoid.</strong><br/>You are primarily a Humanoid, but your vegetable characteristics gives you traits in common with Plants. You have advantage on saves against being paralyzed, petrified, and effects that would cause you to suffer levels of exhaustion.</td><td class="cell-k&gt;[L"><strong>Green Thumb.</strong><br/>When you make an ability check to identify, cultivate, or otherwise interact with plants (not Plant creatures), you can roll a d8 and add the result to the check. In addition, your movement isn’t reduced when passing through areas of difficult terrain created by magical or nonmagical plant growth (you suffer damage or other penalties as normal).</td><td class="cell-ByoG"><strong>Natural Adaptation.</strong><br/>You have inherited one of the following traits, determined by what kind of plant characteristics you want your character to have: <strong>Alliumite, Cruciferan or Tuberkith.</strong></td><td class="cell-^Ouq">—</td></tr><tr id="41d60020-1048-80a5-aef0-d89cbafd19df"><td class="cell-title"><a href="TotV%20Creaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Personajes/LINAJES/Sapopova%2041d60020104880a5aef0d89cbafd19df.html" data-notion-page-id="41d60020-1048-80a5-aef0-d89cbafd19df" data-notion-space-id="45e60020-1048-8158-b5e6-000390bb8870">Sapopova</a></td><td class="cell-tmPH"><span class="selected-value select-value-color-brown">PG2</span></td><td class="cell-@s:n"></td><td class="cell-k&gt;[L"></td><td class="cell-ByoG"></td><td class="cell-^Ouq"></td></tr><tr id="41d60020-1048-80e2-aa5f-d8f0ac70d399"><td class="cell-title"><a href="TotV%20Creaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Personajes/LINAJES/Sea%20Elf%2041d60020104880e2aa5fd8f0ac70d399.html" data-notion-page-id="41d60020-1048-80e2-aa5f-d8f0ac70d399" data-notion-space-id="45e60020-1048-8158-b5e6-000390bb8870">Sea Elf</a></td><td class="cell-tmPH"><span class="selected-value select-value-color-brown">PG2</span></td><td class="cell-@s:n"><strong>Darkvision.</strong><br/>You have darkvision to a range of 60 feet.</td><td class="cell-k&gt;[L"><strong>Seaborn.</strong><br/>You can breathe air and water. In addition, you are perfectly comfortable in temperatures as low as 0 degrees Fahrenheit and you ignore the effects of Extreme Cold hazard (see Player’s Guide).</td><td class="cell-ByoG"><strong>Trance. </strong><br/>Los elfos no necesitan dormir. En cambio, entran en un estado de trance meditativo, permaneciendo semiconscientes durante 4 horas al día. </td><td class="cell-^Ouq">—</td></tr><tr id="41d60020-1048-800d-8a57-cbac04d40575"><td class="cell-title"><a href="TotV%20Creaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Personajes/LINAJES/Shade%2041d600201048800d8a57cbac04d40575.html" data-notion-page-id="41d60020-1048-800d-8a57-cbac04d40575" data-notion-space-id="45e60020-1048-8158-b5e6-000390bb8870">Shade</a></td><td class="cell-tmPH"><span class="selected-value select-value-color-brown">PG2</span></td><td class="cell-@s:n"></td><td class="cell-k&gt;[L"></td><td class="cell-ByoG"></td><td class="cell-^Ouq"></td></tr><tr id="41d60020-1048-8064-8db5-c75db99cf484"><td class="cell-title"><a href="To